        "a": "Credit limit is determined on the basis of several factors like income, credit history, current debts, etc. and the card issuer’s internal policies. The credit limit on your Samsung Axis Bank Credit Card would be communicated to you on card approval and delivery."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is Samsung Axis Bank Signature Card worth it?",
        "a": "Samsung Axis Bank Credit Card can be a good choice for those who frequently purchase Samsung products. However, those who do not want to limit their savings to one or more brands but want solid returns on all online spends should consider other cards."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Samsung Axis Bank Credit Card offer unlimited cashback?",
        "a": "No, 10% cashback on Samsung spends is capped at Rs. 2,500 per month and Rs. 10,000 per year."
      },
      {
        "q": "How to activate my Samsung Axis Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "There are multiple ways to activate your Axis Bank Credit Card including net banking, mobile app, phone banking and ATM. You can also call Axis Bank Customer Care on 1800 209 5577 or 1800 103 5577 to activate your card."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is there any limit on the rewards earning on Samsung Axis Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "No. Only cashback on Samsung spends is capped; there is no capping on reward earning on accelerated categories or other spends."
      }
